  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TASENE 2012-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TASENE 2012-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COSTECH, Sida and NWO/WOTRO agree to establish a joint funding        scheme, called TASENE, for excellent fundamental research projects    open to all scientific disciplines and with relevance for the         research system of Tanzania. The scheme is open for integrated        projects in which two researchers, one from Tanzania the other one    from either Sweden or The Netherlands will cooperate.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">COSTECH, Sida och NWO/WOTRO enades om att tills&#xe4;tta en gemensam       finansiering system kallas TASENE, f&#xf6;r forskningsprojekt, som &#xe4;r      &#xf6;ppna f&#xf6;r alla vetenskapliga discipliner och med relevans f&#xf6;r         forskningssystemet av Tanzania. Systemet &#xe4;r &#xf6;ppet f&#xf6;r integrerade     projekt d&#xe4;r tv&#xe5; forskare, en fr&#xe5;n Tanzania den andra en fr&#xe5;n Sverige  eller Nederl&#xe4;nderna kommer att samarbeta.</narrative>
  </description>
